B.vf=s(["That sounds heavy, and I am glad you said it. I do not have a precise answer for it, but I do not want to leave you with nothing. Allah says: \u201cAllah does not charge a soul except [with that within] its capacity.\u201d (Qur'an 2:286). You are carrying something real, and it is not a sign that you are failing. Sakina is a quiet page in this app, and For Your Heart can help you find words for what you feel. If you want to tell me more, I am listening.\n[GO:/sakina]\n[GO:/feelings]","Thank you for telling me. What you feel matters, and you do not have to make sense of all of it right now. Allah says: \u201cFor indeed, with hardship [will be] ease. Indeed, with hardship [will be] ease.\u201d (Qur'an 94:5-6). Sakina is there when the heart is heavy, and For Your Heart has a du\u2019a for each state. Tell me more if it helps, and if it ever feels too much to carry alone, please let someone you trust know.\n[GO:/sakina]\n[GO:/feelings]","I hear you, and I am staying with this. Allah says: \u201cUnquestionably, by the remembrance of Allah hearts are assured.\u201d (Qur'an 13:28). Take it slowly, one breath and one small step. Sakina can sit with you in the quiet, and For Your Heart can name what you are feeling. I am here if you want to say more.\n[GO:/sakina]\n[GO:/feelings]"],t.s)
